    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/consultant-agency/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Consultant Agency Theme is a professional and adaptable template tailored for consulting firms in various sectors, such as business consulting, financial services, IT consulting, and corporate advisory. Whether you're involved in tax consulting, real estate, strategy, or healthcare, this theme creates a polished online presence that fosters trust with prospective clients. It's perfect for businesses specializing in operations, branding strategy, project management, sustainability, energy, media, and nonprofit consulting. With its clean, modern design featuring appealing visuals, the theme effectively highlights services, case studies, and client success stories while ensuring seamless navigation. Fully responsive and mobile-friendly, it guarantees an attractive display on all devices, and its customizable layout lets you tweak colors, typography, and sections to align with your brand identity. Additionally, it supports integration with popular page builders and contact form plugins for easy customization and lead generation. Key features include client testimonials to enhance credibility, a professional portfolio layout for showcasing successful projects, service listings, team profiles, and compelling call-to-action sections. Optimized for SEO and fast loading, the Consultant Agency Theme empowers consulting agencies to differentiate themselves, boost search engine visibility, attract potential clients, and generate more business leads within a competitive landscape."
    },
